r":"[S9T5]","raw_turn_sha256":"b3071c6f33efd87391fc885c000a07e9cd8455bf0d346079498be351fdcb5b0c","rendered_turn_sha256":"deb73665a704f3ad3af2b8b7564916ef93ae0c7204e1fa33ca5b241b2b03828e","session_date":"2023-06-21","session_datetime":"2023-06-21T15:15:00","session_id":"session_9","session_index":9,"source_sha256":"958f155b2beda5d9069b93930b10b4494b75189dd7d80e5dbc092d084d68134c","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":5},{"dia_id":"D9:6","global_turn_index":158,"locator":"[S9T6]","raw_turn_sha256":"cd90cb7ad8b5c0020a9f7e05f6d157b3b24d693c1efe7c90c7b3d8c974b4f859","rendered_turn_sha256":"dffaf133c57ce50c1b4ebe44d210e569f8239a35cec861b3657a66d54b30abcc","session_date":"2023-06-21","session_datetime":"2023-06-21T15:15:00","session_id":"session_9","session_index":9,"source_sha256":"e2d30c40b4ac6071bb47671740613a951c5ddf1c03c02760079f3e0bf987aaea","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":6}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: Hi Dave! Nice to hear from you. Since last chat, some things have happened. I had a lil car accident last Friday, kinda upsetting but no one was hurt. I've been dealing with insurance and repairs - taking up a lot of time and energy. Look at this photo!\n[Image caption: a photo of a red car with a black rim parked on a sidewalk]\n[S9T1] (dia_id: D9:1)\n\nDave: Sorry to hear about the car accident, Calvin. I'm glad to hear that nobody was hurt. Dealing with insurance and repairs can definitely be time-consuming and draining. Have you encountered any issues in the insurance process so far?\n[S9T2] (dia_id: D9:2)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave, thanks for checking in! The insurance process was a hassle - it took forever and there was a ton of paperwork. But it's all sorted now, and I'm getting it fixed up. Can't wait to drive it again!\n[Image caption: a photo of a tow truck parked in a parking lot]\n[S9T3] (dia_id: D9:3)\n\nDave: How long did it take to get everything sorted out? I'm glad it's all taken care of now!\n[S9T4] (dia_id: D9:4)\n\nCalvin: It only took a week to sort everything out. I was worried about the cost, but it wasn't too bad. Look at this photo from the auto repair shop. \n[Image caption: a photography of a man working on a car in a garage]\n[S9T5] (dia_id: D9:5)\n\nDave: Cool! Glad it wasn't too expensive. Who are him?\n[S9T6] (dia_id: D9:6)","text_sha256":"978d79b8631c772295c63cd0d6defaea893c486a781e8641892035ca9cee08f3","timestamp":"2023-06-21T15:15:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D5:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":34,"line_start":33,"source_locators":["[S5T7]"],"text_sha256":"acf74ea4919bd10706c4f4cd07128cc50f6dd7f3c90935b6b9405a7307a81912"},{"dia_ids":["D5:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":38,"line_start":36,"source_locators":["[S5T8]"],"text_sha256":"496922821f4c583eba942ea291d4ab7c654af909b6cb9ccd56156da226e215fb"},{"dia_ids":["D5:9"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":41,"line_start":40,"source_locators":["[S5T9]"],"text_sha256":"6b0c2afd2551b19c0acc48d07ed603414eaadedc77d8d6efb791c7365cceafa6"},{"dia_ids":["D5:10"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":44,"line_start":43,"source_locators":["[S5T10]"],"text_sha256":"4f0f0ab19844238c2d8d3be87e2b84090602855f1cb3f8b6e29ac094d25ed0c5"},{"dia_ids":["D5:11"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":47,"line_start":46,"source_locators":["[S5T11]"],"text_sha256":"0018ece044174d0af2b2917ed2f181be42afe324d52a867e9a7a98dd9f823d59"},{"dia_ids":["D5:12"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":50,"line_start":49,"source_locators":["[S5T12]"],"text_sha256":"ea7cd9f7cce465213952855339c61b0b37b7dd0696bfe1626309b7b554c0cd59"},{"dia_ids":["D5:13"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":53,"line_start":52,"source_locators":["[S5T13]"],"text_sha256":"bf0f8bdf2b89f21f1549a84420b036468972b6cc88c8799400e7174950f6878d"},{"dia_ids":["D5:14"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":56,"line_start":55,"source_locators":["[S5T14]"],"text_sha256":"19